### ==============================================================================
### ShopCraft API - Day 08: Full-Stack Kotlin HTML DSL & HTMX Verification
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Load Storefront Catalog Page (Full HTML Page via Kotlin HTML DSL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: text/html

### 2. Live Search & Status Filter Partial (Server-Driven HTMX Fragment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui/products?search=Keyboard&status=ACTIVE
Accept: text/html

### 3. Filter by Inactive / Draft Status Partial
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui/products?status=DRAFT
Accept: text/html

### 4. Load Admin Operations Dashboard (Full HTML Page with Inventory & Metrics)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui/admin
Accept: text/html

### 5. Refresh Real-Time Security Audit & Telemetry Feed (HTMX Fragment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ui/audit
Accept: text/html
